  << /ActualText (The disaggregated calibration optimization convergence required an average of 35\02345\045 fewer iterations compared to the traditional calibration approach\056 The mean calibration runtime decreased by approximately 25\045\056\nAcross all validation periods\054 the\240 disaggregated calibration approach achieved lower error metrics than the traditional approach\056 Root Mean Square Error \050RMSE\051 decreased by 15\05520\045\056)
     /K [ 105 ]
     /P 1940 0 R
