1941 0 obj
  << /ActualText (    Average peak flow prediction error decreased by 30\045\054 and event volume prediction error decreased by 47\045\056 Parameter variability across repeated optimization runs was also reduced\056 \nWhen independently modeled sub\055signals were combined\054 the modeled peak flow rate and event volume showed less bias than values predicted by the models calibrated with the traditional approach\056 Overall\054 the disaggregated framework demonstrated measurable improvements in calibration efficiency\054 predictive accuracy\054 and parameter robustness relative to the traditional combined\055model approach\056\n)
     /K [ 107 ]
